# W7i, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; from @200 b's link keeps hanging open; b's lag debt takes it out of a's stage group
# within its second cut (about @211), a leads on alone, still host.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
wander -150 -60 20 until present=1 fail epoch>=@300
log a plays on without b
wander -150 -60 20 until epoch>=@325 fail stage=stagml11
log a stayed host
